’:\r\n\r\n    rename, round_any\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">library(&quot;RGoogleAnalytics&quot;)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Loading required package: lubridate\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">\r\nAttaching package: ‘lubridate’\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">The following object is masked from ‘package:reshape’:\r\n\r\n    stamp\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">The following object is masked from ‘package:plyr’:\r\n\r\n    here\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Loading required package: httr\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\"><a href=\"http://client.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://client.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238117304000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2eUTi6NJfmljXe-epON_ui\">client.id</a> &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"http://xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238117304000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1n4QcarXeYMu8LEPtPDFRW\">xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com</a>&quot;\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">client.secret &lt;- &quot;xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx&quot;\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">token &lt;- Auth(<a href=\"http://client.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://client.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238117304000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2eUTi6NJfmljXe-epON_ui\">client.id</a>, client.secret)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">save(token, file=&quot;C:/R/token_file&quot;)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">ValidateToken(token)\r\n</span>Access Token is valid\r\n<span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">query.list &lt;- Init(start.date=&quot;2015-11-29&quot;,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">                   end.date=&quot;2015-12-29&quot;,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">                   dimensions=&quot;ga:date&quot;,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">                   metrics=&quot;ga:sessions,ga:pageviews,ga:users&quot;,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">                   max.results=10000,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">                   sort=&quot;-ga:date&quot;,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">                   <a href=\"http://table.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://table.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238117304000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0RH96xcr66Zlp2DZxKiD5e\">table.id</a>=&quot;ga:XXXXXXXX&quot;)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">ga.query &lt;- QueryBuilder(query.list)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">ga.data &lt;- GetReportData(ga.query, token)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in ParseDataFeedJSON(GA.Data) : \r\n  code : 403 Reason : User does not have sufficient permissions for this profile.</span></pre><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br>我找了一下該錯誤碼的資料</font><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">發現</span></span>只有兩個網頁有此敘述<br><a href=\"http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:A3xfExnU1l4J:productforums.google.com/d/topic/analytics/pO_UAZGNOxU+&amp;cd=2&amp;hl=zh-TW&amp;ct=clnk&amp;gl=tw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q%3Dcache:A3xfExnU1l4J:productforums.google.com/d/topic/analytics/pO_UAZGNOxU%2B%26cd%3D2%26hl%3Dzh-TW%26ct%3Dclnk%26gl%3Dtw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238117304000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1St6VDC-u7YMTIuoUOJKE4\">其一</a>有說是否可以看到</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">account/property/view，我確實都可以看到<br>另外一個也是有相同的問題但似乎還沒答案<br>想請問一下各位有遇過相同的問題或有解決的答案嗎<br>感謝<br></span></div>"
